WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.563
In two minutes, you will have a live neighborhood contest, with its own link and QR code.

00:00:05.563 --> 00:00:06.252
Let's start.

00:00:07.155 --> 00:00:10.487
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:12.336 --> 00:00:14.759
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:14.759 --> 00:00:17.249
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:17.249 --> 00:00:18.594
Tap Use my location.

00:00:20.331 --> 00:00:22.547
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:22.547 --> 00:00:23.198
Tap Allow.

00:00:25.532 --> 00:00:27.275
The map zooms to where you are.

00:00:27.275 --> 00:00:31.360
There are no events on your street, so tap Show all of Southern California.

00:00:33.025 --> 00:00:38.168
Now every place shows how far away it is, nearest first, so you can plan your drive.

00:00:39.068 --> 00:00:41.564
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:41.564 --> 00:00:42.781
See the three dots?

00:00:42.781 --> 00:00:43.329
Tap them.

00:00:44.936 --> 00:00:46.515
In the menu, tap Add.

00:00:48.275 --> 00:00:49.458
Three choices.

00:00:49.458 --> 00:00:50.562
Tap A contest.

00:00:52.397 --> 00:00:53.673
Name your contest.

00:00:53.673 --> 00:00:55.485
Type a name, then tap Next.

00:00:58.426 --> 00:00:59.567
Who is running it?

00:00:59.567 --> 00:01:02.269
Type the name, pick your city, then tap Next.

00:01:05.354 --> 00:01:07.931
This welcome message is already written.

00:01:07.931 --> 00:01:09.313
Keep it, and tap Next.

00:01:11.119 --> 00:01:12.845
A website is optional.

00:01:12.845 --> 00:01:14.497
Skip it, and tap Next.

00:01:16.426 --> 00:01:18.716
These dates are filled in for you.

00:01:18.716 --> 00:01:19.305
Tap Next.

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:22.681
Choose Quick start.

00:01:22.681 --> 00:01:24.713
It sets everything up for you.

00:01:24.713 --> 00:01:25.631
Then tap Next.

00:01:28.209 --> 00:01:30.949
Check your details, and tap Create contest.

00:01:33.522 --> 00:01:35.170
Your contest is live!

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:36.819
Tap Open my dashboard.

00:01:38.755 --> 00:01:43.132
This is your dashboard, with your link and QR code, ready to share.

00:01:44.335 --> 00:01:47.342
Next up: Create a contest with Customize.
